@startuml uc-sync-properties
!include _theme.iuml

state syncProperties as "syncProperties()" {

  state " " as RequestingSync
  state " " as Reconciling
  state " " as Writing

  [*] --> RequestingSync
  note on link
  <b>Operator</b> asks for the organisation property schema to
  match the types the configuration declares
  end note

  RequestingSync --> Reconciling
  note on link
  <b>Octoform</b> compares the declared type values and the
  explicitly declared repository assignments with the schema
  that the organisation currently carries
  end note

  Reconciling --> Writing
  note on link
  <b>Octoform</b> converges the allowed values and the declared
  assignments
  • a repository the configuration does not mention
    keeps whatever value it has
  • an organisation custom-property write needs
    admin:org on a classic token
  end note

  Writing --> [*]
  note on link
  <b>Operator</b> receives the outcome of each write separately
  end note
}

syncProperties --> PROPERTY_SCHEMA_SYNCHRONIZED
note on link
the schema and declared values converged; exit 0
end note

syncProperties -[#A78BFA]-> CONFIGURATION_RESOLVED
note on link
custom properties are an organisation feature,
so this use case does not apply to a personal
account; a write failure exits 5
end note
@enduml
